DESCRIPTION >
    Verified group manifests for atomic browser session corrections.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` String `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `group_id` String `json:$.group_id`,
    `sequence` UInt64 `json:$.sequence`,
    `member_count` UInt32 `json:$.member_count`,
    `content_hash` FixedString(64) `json:$.content_hash`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, group_id, sequence
